<title>USA: GE Spacenet to buy AT&amp;T'S Tridom unit.</title>
<headline>GE Spacenet to buy AT&amp;T'S Tridom unit.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric's Capital Spacenet Services Inc said Friday it agreed to buy AT&amp;T Tridom, a satellite communications network unit of AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>GE Spacenet said the acquisition of AT&amp;T Tridom's 56-hub facilities, which support about 20,000 sites, will &quot;significantly&quot; enhance its capabilities to provide global communications services using Very Small Aperture Terminal (VSAT) technology.  </p>
<p>AT&amp;T Tridom said the agreement, signed Friday, was part of AT&amp;T's strategy to shed non-core businesses.</p>
</text>
